# Patterns the pre-publish gate refuses to let into the repo. One ERE per line,
# matched case-insensitively. Copy to ~/.config/knowledge/scrub-patterns.txt and
# replace these with your own — and keep that copy OUT of the repo, because a
# filled-in version of this file describes your employer in some detail.
#
# Add a pattern the moment you notice a leak; the list is the memory.

# The organisation the store is about
acme

# Vendor stack that appears in your facts
examplevendor|anothervendor

# Your own name and handles
yourname

# Ticket prefixes, so a real key never ends up in an example
\b(ABC|XYZ)-[0-9]+

# Registry, cluster and host naming conventions
acmeregistry|aks-acme

# Internal group aliases
(dev|platform|managers)@

# Mail domains
@acme\.(com|io)

# The path your private notes live under
private-notes|notes/acme
